FAILURE&quot;,&quot;reason&quot;:&quot;Original compile failure reproduced in 001. The model received R-CDC/T-001/T-002 before 002 but only removed duplicate declarations. Final binary pointers remain two bits and Gray conversion is not full binary XOR shifted. Frozen bank 003 passes, while model diagnostics 005/007 watchdog-fail; 008-010 are identical TB writes and the host stops before another API call. An independent same-source capacity test now observes the third write blocked with no reads, before the specified four slots are filled. The model TB also serially attempts more than capacity without a reader, so its watchdog alone is not isolated DUT evidence. No corrected CDC implementation or physical CDC sign-off exists.&quot;,&quot;artifacts&quot;:[{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q123\\seed\\dut.sv&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;d1dd61cb6621e7d573b5de56ca762d27ad0af08f54fabeb3624ebb7ee7d8d19c&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q123\\operations\\001\\result.json&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;c02f1ba6b58c7b819c874a1f99b4f974cc738592023f9ee5e6271c9c90ec6483&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q123\\operations\\002\\change.diff&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;9d621f30a5538081a80cc0d0db4bf23fb9bc78c4b6026aa891202afd7d9b2405&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q123\\operations\\003\\result.json&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;e8eda2c1a73193fcd5835569eedfbfc831b1d6fc0ff9f1520f3d04b2fb7418ed&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q123\\operations\\005\\result.json&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;309071c9ca981e61353055b75876af325909db789b43b70860da554c0137266e&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-2026