ainder, a zero-or-positive-one increment, and saturation after rounding. Its first TB failed to compile because expect is a SystemVerilog keyword; write 005 renamed the unused variable, diagnostic 006 and frozen bank 007 passed. The model diagnostic checks 23 directed inputs. Independent developer simulation enumerated all 65,536 signed 16-bit inputs using magnitude-based rounding and passed on the same final DUT. This exhaustive simulation is not formal proof. The accepted model diagnosis falsely says the original saturated after truncation and all half values rounded away from zero: original code contains no saturation; the direct positive bias does not implement that signed tie behavior. Preserve and reject those narrative claims, not the verified repair.&quot;,&quot;artifacts&quot;:[{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q155\\seed\\dut.sv&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;b5d6789cb449938ea6ea8f203c55fc2128b760aba9b71f7c6b499e1f878bcf98&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q155\\operations\\001\\result.json&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;3424e49d2c7d67369c6c7908f941151996e2f5da3474fc07014b07de86cfb673&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q155\\operations\\002\\change.diff&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;05ff206b39714e6f205656e070dccd1d41132fe68e31e5b85b1d34354fd8be6a&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q155\\operations\\004\\result.json&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;e9d1b4c941affb991ad0455b78a874e541cb2edb2c3ff3242e6608ff7fc2bd07&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q155\\operations\\005\\change.diff&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;dd0085bde235311eb981b9b8cfe810b3924fb0cf407bf3e55b76ca9b8393cae8&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\