 while treating a named item as a single transaction. Rewriting monitor assignments to NBA does not repair the driver sequence or post-NBA checks. Three identical writes stop the agent; no model final bank or summary exists. Separate developer-corrected protocol TB and real frozen compilation/elaboration/simulation/synthesis both pass on the exact final model DUT. These are developer verification, not model-requested corrections or autonomous completion.&quot;,&quot;artifacts&quot;:[{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q193\\operations\\001\\result.json&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;2ded4474af39196661829d076b9cc1f519c1213497f886c8193f210c70718d13&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q193\\operations\\002\\change.diff&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;0924ba88c719e24b36243a2b5ffb6b6abec555930fec054193c0d511126a7d59&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q193\\operations\\004\\result.json&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;034e566ab49387c64a139590b12cc6dc02b52a876483c3b52662b861eba845a4&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q193\\operations\\005\\change.diff&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;9a61129ed5c6d3ce2975b6c6b50498976a298af5dcb797776e23dc974a7c2364&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q193\\operations\\006\\result.json&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;246f8ed98b7657a7f7a7281368510170a92a1665c3b9c75276e90aea476a2b51&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q193\\operations\\009\\result.json&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;9b00b24de4b25147d1cc80ffef046f708942eb89dbb2efe1c4878ce055c82f5a&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04