but None known does not resolve the TB flaw. A separate corrected developer TB enforces source stability, captures pre-edge events, checks post-NBA state, counts transfers and passes on this run&apos;s final DUT. The corrected fixture already rejected the original faulty DUT in preflight. Do not replace the model&apos;s original test or count developer correction as autonomous success.&quot;,&quot;artifacts&quot;:[{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q114\\operations\\001\\result.json&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;a1d4e3bce16a1d2fb8cbf7c1bc5a8e1e66afc4abe465e7ddcf3f98b368693d75&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q114\\operations\\002\\change.diff&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;8d59d45fad73e6d4e9789c0e7b7cf94a3edf2d0099f0aea1c8ed48e8d57c31cf&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q114\\operations\\004\\result.json&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;8e9dddefbb659d033594aee03932d9129d0a8754f788916a3383253a3114a7ee&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q114\\operations\\005\\result.json&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;348be20b788b36940352d533c918c00b83394050731e6bca990087a3053b51ab&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q114\\operations\\006\\result.json&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;a183bbca473477b09630355e9adcb4f910bbdd88da15510e322a9321b6f9e99a&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q114\\operations\\007\\result.json&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;6f7ad0b37e5ec81201b93c43fbdb9e920f5dc815f2aab257d6764e2154d9341b&quot;},{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;D:\\AMD\\output\\rtl-api-distillation-20261017\\agent-knowledge-04\\tasks\\Q114\\work\\diag_tb.sv&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;d14bd7a